sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as lowpriv
  participant V as victim account
  participant CA as ADESC-Root-CA
  participant DC as KDC
  Note over A,V: lowpriv holds GenericWrite over victim
  A->>V: account update -upn administrator@adescrtl.lab
  Note over A,CA: Template ESC9 = CT_FLAG_NO_SECURITY_EXTENSION (no SID stamped)
  A->>CA: req -template ESC9 (as victim, who now has admin UPN)
  CA-->>A: Cert with UPN=administrator, no SID binding
  A->>V: restore victim UPN (cleanup)
  A->>DC: PKINIT with cert -> weak binding maps UPN to administrator
  DC-->>A: TGT as administrator
